    "spring": "",
    "summer": "",
    "fall": "",
    "winter": ""
  },
  "funFact": "The Sleepy Orange gets its unusual common name from the appearance of dark eyespots on the underside of its hindwings, which resemble closed eyes when the butterfly rests with its wings folded.",
